cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this tool contributes to your published work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TableTurner: Excel-to-GenBank annotation conversion"
authors:
  - family-names: Houston
    given-names: Robert
repository-code: "https://github.com/FeatureConvert/TableTurner"
url: "https://github.com/FeatureConvert/TableTurner"
license: MIT
version: 1.1.0-beta
date-released: "2026-08-03"
abstract: >-
  TableTurner converts a filled-in Excel annotation template into either
  NCBI's 5-column tab-delimited feature table (for BankIt/WebSub submission)
  or a complete GenBank flat file (.gb), automating the manual transcription
  step in phage/small-genome sequencing and annotation workflows.
